  "id": "zap",
  "title": "ZAP",
  "summary": "Turns hits into lasers: a fast pitch sweep at the start of each sound.",
  "steps": [
    "Add ZAP to a lead, an FX or percussion.",
    "Pitch and Amount say how high the laser starts; Sweep and Length say how fast it falls.",
    "Sync makes the zaps follow the beat.",
    "The deep bass is never touched."
  ],
